/begin CHARACTERISTIC KF_TI_TU_F
  "Tuning-Faktor f. TI | [Code V452 INJ 0x60654] Per-cylinder injection trim - the S85/MSS65 form of MSS60 GKF_TI_TU_F_ZYL[i] (PSB: 'S85 MS_S65: KF_TI_TU_F(n,ZYL), K_TI_GA'). Final step: ti_tpu_zyl[i] = max(ti_berech_zyl[i], KF_TI_SOLL_MIN) x KF_TI_TU_F(n, i) x K_TI_GA, then limited to ti_max. Y = cylinder 1..10 (index = bank x 5 + k: 1-5 bank 1, 6-10 bank 2; rows 11-12 unused). Exact per cylinder (no interpolation between rows), linear over n only - no load axis, and no transient weighting (MSS60 KL_TI_TU_F_WICHT does not exist in V452). Step 1/128 = 0.78 %. All 1.00 in this file. Lambda control/LAA removes any bank-average change; only the spread within a bank remains."
  MAP
  0x7862E
  TKF_SW_SW_UW
  100.0
  FORMULA_0805
  0.0
  10.0000   
  /begin AXIS_DESCR
    STD_AXIS
    FORMULA_0006
    6
    0.0
    10000.0000
  /end AXIS_DESCR
  /begin AXIS_DESCR
    STD_AXIS
    Zylinder
    FORMULA_1187
    12
    1.0000    
    12.0000   
  /end AXIS_DESCR
  FORMAT "%5.2"
/end CHARACTERISTIC


